# This repository ships installers through GitHub Releases, never through the tree.
# Keep binaries out of git history: a 9 MB .exe committed today is 9 MB every
# clone until the end of time, while a Release asset is stored separately and
# gets a download counter.
*.exe
*.msi
*.crx
*.zip
!Extension.zip

# Local scratch
/dist/
/release/
*.tmp
*.log

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
